	"talks": [
		{
			"id": 2303501,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2303501
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2303501",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2303501,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Fukumoto"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230350101,
					"content": "*sigh* I want to go back to Inazuma... How could this happen to me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350102,
						230350103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350102,
					"content": "What's wrong?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350104,
					"content": "Traveler? *sigh* Don't even mention the novel. Those researchers working on Genius Invokation TCG are barely holding it together.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350105,
					"content": "According to a researcher I know quite well, the team encountered all kinds of problems that could only be described as baffling...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350106,
					"content": "For example, a Haravatat researcher suddenly asked a question one day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350107,
					"content": "He said that if the effect descriptions on the cards are too long, it might discourage people who aren't used to reading long blocks of text from playing the game.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350108,
					"content": "Researchers are used to reading large chunks of text and aren't affected by this issue, but the long descriptions could very well turn potential players away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350109,
					"content": "So he suggested cutting the amount of text on some cards in half to make them easier to read.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350110,
						230350111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350110,
					"content": "Is that really necessary?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350112,
					"content": "It's not a problem to me... But the researchers are still working hard on this issue. After all, it's about the player's experience, and the fewer problems, the better.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350113,
					"content": "Anyway... There's an even bigger problem. They promised to help me find models for my novel, but something went wrong with that, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350114,
					"content": "Remember? I told you earlier about a researcher who said they'd introduce me to Tighnari and Cyno, and ask them to be the inspirations for my novel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350115,
					"content": "But they're so busy. I don't think I can count on them for a while...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350116,
						230350117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350116,
					"content": "What will you do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350118,
					"content": "The researcher who received me was not able to help me with this, but he gave me an idea.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350119,
					"content": "He said Cyno sometimes goes to Puspa Café to play cards.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350120,
					"content": "If I want... I can try my luck there first. Or maybe they'll help me get in touch when they're free.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350121,
					"content": "And... what are your thoughts?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350122,
					"content": "*sigh* By the time they're free, I'll have finished writing the novel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350123,
					"content": "I guess I'll go myself and see if I can find Cyno.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350124,
					"content": "But if I'm lucky enough to meet Cyno at the café, how should I even introduce myself to him? What a dilemma...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350128,
						230350129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350128,
					"content": "I can help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350130,
					"content": "Really!? That's amazing! But how did you... Uh, you know what? I'm not gonna pry further.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350131,
					"content": "What are we waiting for then? Let's head to Puspa Café right now! Hope we'll be able to catch Cyno...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350129,
					"content": "I know Cyno pretty well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350117,
					"content": "How will you get in touch?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350111,
					"content": "Is it really that long...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350103,
					"content": "Got writer's block?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350104
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2303503,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2303503
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2303503",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2303503,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Fukumoto"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230350301,
					"content": "Shh... I—Isn't that Cyno?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350302,
					"content": "Look at his outfit, his hairstyle, and that hair color... This is exactly what a protagonist in a card game novel should look like!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350303,
						230350305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350303,
					"content": "This has no rhyme nor reason...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350304,
					"content": "Heh, just trust my instincts on the market. But now's not a good time to explain...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350309,
					"content": "Traveler, please ask Cyno to be the model for my novel... I'm counting on you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350305,
					"content": "I actually know quite a lot of people who can fit into this category...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350306,
					"content": "Really? That's great. I'm working on the third book of \"King of Invokations,\" and this time, I'm not going to base it on the gameplay mechanics of Genius Invokation TCG.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350307,
					"content": "I'm going to create an all-new way of playing. For instance... I could get all cards to be suspended mid-air on the field. Players will have to collect cards as they consider their next move, all the while preventing their opponent from collecting cards themselves...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350308,
					"content": "Hahaha! I'm getting excited just thinking about it! But we don't have time for this right now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2303504,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2303504
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2303504",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2303504,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Cyno"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230350401,
					"content": "...Hmm, this combination of cards isn't so bad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350402,
					"content": "But they're not strong enough to deal with quick attacks...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350403,
					"content": "What are you up to, Cyno?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350404,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}? I didn't expect to see you here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350405,
					"content": "I'm in the middle of trying to build a Genius Invokation deck with a relatively slow attack speed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350406,
					"content": "I'm hoping that the deck would allow the player to obtain an abundance of resources and plenty of powerful cards...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350407,
					"content": "But to be honest, it's hard to build a deck like that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350408,
					"content": "Currently, in the Genius Invokation TCG community, some players prefer to use cards with fast attack speeds.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350409,
					"content": "At the beginning of the game, they play a large number of cards in one go in order to swiftly defeat their opponent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350410,
					"content": "But I'm no fan of this tactic. I prefer to continuously accumulate resources in different ways...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350411,
					"content": "Seizing every possible opportunity, building up my advantage, and eventually securing the victory...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350412,
					"content": "Yes, yes! Wonderful! You're just like the main character in my novel!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350413,
					"content": "Sorry! Uh... I'm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350414,
						230350415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350414,
					"content": "This is Fukumoto.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350415,
					"content": "This is the author of \"King of Invokations.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350416,
					"content": "Hello, General Mahamatra. I don't suppose you've heard of me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350417,
					"content": "I've read your novel. It's very good.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350418,
					"content": "I'm truly honored!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350419,
					"content": "In the novel, every time the protagonist is at a disadvantage, he always manages to get a card that wasn't in his deck through various means, then defeats his opponent. This left a lasting impression on me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350420,
					"content": "I understand that writing novels requires taking a creative license, but this way of winning is a departure from the fundamental mechanics of Genius Invokation TCG.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350421,
					"content": "About that, well... Although I do play Genius Invokation TCG a lot, I'm not really good at it... And if you write about the duels with a competitive mindset, it wouldn't make for an interesting story.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350422,
					"content": "Hmm, is that so? Well, as luck would have it, I've just built two decks of cards, so we can play a few rounds of Genius Invokation TCG here. Maybe you'll find some inspiration.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350423,
						230350424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyno"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350423,
					"content": "(Now they are about to play cards...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350424,
					"content": "(This guy simply wants to play cards...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230350425,
					"content": "Eh? Playing with... with you? I'd love to, but the truth is...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230350426,
						230350427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fukumoto"
				},
				{
					"id": 230350426,
					"content": "I'll explain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 230350427,
					"content": "About Fukumoto's request...",
